        <mxCell id="notes" value="Reading this map:&#xa;• one cylinder = one shard (a real table, e.g. fleets_102016)&#xa;• stacked cylinders in a slot = co-located — same hash range, same&#xa;  worker, so joins run on the worker itself&#xa;• vbr_* = vehicles_by_region shards; dashed = empty shard&#xa;• shard ids come from an example run — yours will differ numerically&#xa;• vehicle_telematics is a LOCAL table on the coordinator: native range&#xa;  partitions (pg_inherits), not Citus shard placements" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
